WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.158 --> 00:28.829
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.829 --> 00:36.235
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.503 --> 00:41.342
I seek boundless strength

00:41.342 --> 00:52.119
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.119 --> 00:54.221
I want to protect

00:54.221 --> 00:56.523
I want to believe

00:56.523 --> 01:00.828
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.828 --> 01:05.132
The heat and the love

01:05.132 --> 01:09.403
I accept them all

01:09.403 --> 01:13.007
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.007 --> 01:21.540
Aiming towards that light...

01:31.458 --> 01:35.155
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:35.963 --> 01:38.523
I'll give this to you then.

01:39.266 --> 01:41.359
We'll exchange each
other's sachets.

01:42.369 --> 01:44.599
You can't use the same
trick twice!

01:45.372 --> 01:46.740
Guren!

01:46.740 --> 01:48.230
Masahiro!

01:53.814 --> 01:57.045
I see. This is good stuff.

01:58.152 --> 02:00.921
An injury that doesn't heal...
A permanent injury...

02:00.921 --> 02:03.412
An indication of prey.

02:04.391 --> 02:07.121
I'll take it from here.

02:07.227 --> 02:08.695
You were certainly stupid,
weren't you?

02:08.695 --> 02:11.231
Allowing the demons
to trick you,

02:11.231 --> 02:13.597
and going down
a forbidden road.

02:15.436 --> 02:18.701
Crush the Curse of Darkness

02:29.817 --> 02:31.648
The 12 shikigami spirit...

02:36.056 --> 02:38.258
- Seiryuu!
- Don't say my name.

02:38.258 --> 02:41.284
Don't call yourself an onmyouji
when you aren't one yet.

02:45.833 --> 02:47.300
Where's Akiko?!

02:51.738 --> 02:55.109
- No way... Akiko!
- Masahiro!

02:55.109 --> 02:57.711
Guren, let go of me!
Akiko is!

02:57.711 --> 03:00.441
Calm down! Princess Akiko
is still alive!

03:01.181 --> 03:03.547
- She's not dead?
- That's right!

03:08.689 --> 03:11.558
But she doesn't have
much longer to live.

03:11.558 --> 03:14.862
Brazen priest, how dare
you harass our master!

03:14.862 --> 03:17.626
I'll slay you right
there and then!

03:34.047 --> 03:35.849
What took you so long?

03:35.849 --> 03:39.216
Why don't you just set everything
ablaze with your precious flames?

03:41.321 --> 03:42.788
Forbid!

03:44.591 --> 03:46.149
Destructive tear!

03:54.268 --> 03:56.003
Pathetic. You're pathetic.

03:56.003 --> 03:59.336
There's no way
you can defeat us.

04:00.474 --> 04:01.964
Not again?

04:06.146 --> 04:07.613
Rikugou!

04:08.849 --> 04:10.450
[chant]

04:10.450 --> 04:12.418
You're a hindrance! Get lost!

04:13.687 --> 04:15.222
What's wrong with you?!

04:15.222 --> 04:18.487
- You irritate me!
- Seiryuu! Come on!

04:19.660 --> 04:21.828
A useless child who
depends on Touda,

04:21.828 --> 04:24.164
whose powers have
deteriorated?

04:24.164 --> 04:27.067
This child's going to be
Seimei's heir?

04:27.067 --> 04:29.501
It must be a ridiculous mistake!

04:32.773 --> 04:35.606
Seiryuu, stop finding
fault with me!

04:36.476 --> 04:38.979
I may be a childish and
half-baked onmyouji,

04:38.979 --> 04:42.249
but saving Akiko is
the top priority now!

04:42.249 --> 04:43.750
I'll handle this one,

04:43.750 --> 04:45.819
and the shikigami will
take care of the rest.

04:45.819 --> 04:49.482
Is that so? Show me what
you're capable of then!

04:51.158 --> 04:53.319
[chant]

04:55.028 --> 04:58.657
[chant]

05:04.238 --> 05:06.638
[chant]

05:08.308 --> 05:10.242
[chant]

05:11.378 --> 05:14.814
Is he trying to wake the
dragon deity of Kifune?

05:19.886 --> 05:25.085
[chant]

05:27.027 --> 05:29.086
You can never defeat me!

05:33.900 --> 05:35.333
Masahiro!

05:39.072 --> 05:41.942
I thought I'd have a
lot more fun than this.

05:41.942 --> 05:43.877
So he was just empty talk
after all.

05:43.877 --> 05:46.710
Let's put an end
to this right now!

05:50.284 --> 05:52.819
Masahiro, hang on!

05:52.819 --> 05:55.185
Masahiro... Masahiro!

05:56.023 --> 05:57.854
Masahiro...

05:59.159 --> 06:03.823
You'll definitely become a
successful onmyouji just like me.

06:04.097 --> 06:08.534
Really? But I can't seem to
do it well sometimes.

06:10.337 --> 06:14.908
You'll have to ask
the deities for help then.

06:14.908 --> 06:18.173
I did ask for help,
but it didn't work.

06:19.446 --> 06:22.449
I see. Then...

06:22.449 --> 06:25.247
I'll teach you
something special now.

06:25.752 --> 06:29.956
Using this country's language,
ask for help once more.

06:29.956 --> 06:33.627
- This country's language...
- That's right, Masahiro.

06:33.627 --> 06:37.164
If someone asked you something
in a foreign language,

06:37.164 --> 06:39.132
you'll be baffled too, won't you?

06:43.136 --> 06:46.162
This country's language...

06:52.112 --> 06:57.311
Embrace and praise all deities,

06:58.051 --> 07:01.111
divide the origins of the stars...

07:08.562 --> 07:09.995
What?!

07:10.197 --> 07:15.168
[chant]

07:15.168 --> 07:17.104
This... It is...

07:17.104 --> 07:22.440
[chant]

07:23.143 --> 07:25.345
Submit, purify and destroy!

07:25.345 --> 07:30.180
Tear apart this binding spell
and come before us!

07:32.152 --> 07:34.177
The Deity of Water!

07:43.597 --> 07:47.089
It can't be!

07:48.034 --> 07:50.161
That's i-impossible...

08:08.188 --> 08:10.213
Seiryuu, did you see that?

08:11.491 --> 08:15.120
The prowess of the heir that
Abe no Seimei has chosen.

08:15.762 --> 08:18.598
And that's just part of
the power he possesses.

08:18.598 --> 08:20.066
A part?

08:20.066 --> 08:23.934
You mean... he's more
powerful than that?

08:24.371 --> 08:27.932
Masahiro... Hey Masahiro!
You must be strong!

08:31.044 --> 08:32.671
Guren...

08:33.547 --> 08:35.139
Akiko!

08:36.616 --> 08:39.744
Akiko! Akiko!

08:41.888 --> 08:44.755
Akiko! Akiko!

08:49.296 --> 08:52.060
I'm glad that we
aren't too late!

08:57.671 --> 09:00.574
Darn you! How could
you do that!

09:00.574 --> 09:04.510
You shall pay with your
lives for killing Shun!

09:07.881 --> 09:10.349
- Guren!
- Masahiro...

09:12.552 --> 09:15.521
W-What... is it, Akiko?

09:23.196 --> 09:24.686
What?!

09:48.855 --> 09:51.187
Aki... ko...

10:19.119 --> 10:21.417
Keiko! Keiko!

10:38.438 --> 10:42.275
Keiko! That's great!
I'm so glad!

10:42.275 --> 10:45.676
What have I done
all this while?

10:46.546 --> 10:48.036
Keiko...

10:57.557 --> 10:59.025
That's over.

10:59.025 --> 11:01.361
A woman seeking revenge
can truly be...

11:01.361 --> 11:04.262
terrifying and heartbreaking
at the same time.

11:08.501 --> 11:10.469
Masahiro...

11:20.246 --> 11:24.148
You did... a great job, girl...

11:30.724 --> 11:32.658
Masahiro!

11:38.064 --> 11:41.261
Pitiful! That's pitiful!

11:41.768 --> 11:45.105
You didn't even realize that
the girl was being manipulated.

11:45.105 --> 11:48.370
You pathetic... priest!

11:52.379 --> 11:55.280
Masahiro...

12:05.725 --> 12:09.126
The golden brace that
Seimei used to restrain him...

12:16.536 --> 12:18.094
Touda...

12:19.539 --> 12:21.268
This is?

12:24.210 --> 12:25.745
Guren...

12:25.745 --> 12:28.348
Did you break the brace...

12:28.348 --> 12:32.375
because you were in
too much suffering?

12:33.286 --> 12:35.447
I have to calm him down.

12:54.441 --> 12:56.068
Guren...

13:05.018 --> 13:06.486
Guren.

13:06.486 --> 13:09.649
I'm all right...

13:11.124 --> 13:14.861
- Masahiro...
- I gave you my word...

13:14.861 --> 13:19.628
I'll become an outstanding
and unrivalled onmyouji.

13:22.602 --> 13:24.331
Guren...

13:27.807 --> 13:31.538
Scent of Aloeswood,
engulf him...

13:35.448 --> 13:38.008
Please relieve Guren's suffering!

13:45.391 --> 13:47.416
Guren...

13:59.806 --> 14:03.343
This is the place where I belong.

14:03.343 --> 14:06.412
Everything will be wiped
out by my flames.

14:06.412 --> 14:09.482
Nobody will be hurt
if I remain here.

14:09.482 --> 14:13.748
That's the reason why I must
stay here on my own.

14:17.624 --> 14:22.195
The scent of Aloeswood?
That is...

14:22.195 --> 14:23.897
I finally found you!

14:23.897 --> 14:27.500
Mokkun, why are you here?

14:27.500 --> 14:30.628
- I've been searching for you.
- You...

14:31.738 --> 14:33.933
Hey, what are you doing?

14:36.976 --> 14:38.466
I...

14:39.245 --> 14:41.145
I'm in this form...

14:42.081 --> 14:45.151
This place is cold.
And dark and lonely too.

14:45.151 --> 14:47.453
- Let's go.
- Where to?

14:47.453 --> 14:50.251
Home, of course.

14:52.025 --> 14:54.427
Mokkun, you feel so warm.

14:54.427 --> 14:57.063
You'll keep me warm
before we get home.

14:57.063 --> 14:58.997
That's not true!

15:00.133 --> 15:01.691
Mokkun?

15:03.369 --> 15:06.973
Touda is an emotionless
and a terrifying monster.

15:06.973 --> 15:10.076
It'd be better for everyone
if I'm on my own.

15:10.076 --> 15:13.713
You're silly,
making that face again.

15:13.713 --> 15:17.317
I've told you before.
Say so when it hurts.

15:17.317 --> 15:19.376
I'll definitely listen to you.

15:21.087 --> 15:23.022
Now then, let's go back.

15:23.022 --> 15:24.853
The two of us.

15:28.328 --> 15:31.798
Come, let's go home
together, Mokkun.

15:31.798 --> 15:33.322
Masahiro!

15:48.281 --> 15:49.942
Masahiro!

15:51.684 --> 15:53.553
What happened?

15:53.553 --> 15:55.688
Touda actually calmed down?

15:55.688 --> 15:59.021
The kid was using his
powers again?

16:02.061 --> 16:04.859
Masahiro, Masahiro!

16:07.133 --> 16:11.092
I'd never let you die!
Even if I must die in your stead!

16:20.580 --> 16:23.516
- Seimei!
- You can't do that! You'll...

16:23.516 --> 16:25.245
Leave me alone!

16:30.189 --> 16:31.457
I see.

16:31.457 --> 16:36.053
This child... He was
the one who set me free?

16:37.797 --> 16:40.033
The dragon deity of Kifune.

16:40.033 --> 16:42.835
He's still a young boy.

16:42.835 --> 16:46.327
It'd be a great pity if such
a gifted boy were left to die.

16:47.373 --> 16:52.675
To show my gratitude to him
for lifting the spell,

16:54.113 --> 16:56.604
I shall save him this time.

17:19.472 --> 17:21.607
Masahiro!

17:21.607 --> 17:23.507
Mokkun...

17:25.812 --> 17:29.612
Don't be silly. You're not
responsible for this.

17:30.216 --> 17:35.882
Well, it seems I'm helpless
without you after all...

17:39.625 --> 17:43.322
Don't fret. He's just asleep.

17:44.263 --> 17:46.197
Masahiro...

17:47.200 --> 17:52.297
Why do you always
treat me... like that?

18:00.847 --> 18:03.716
With the release of
the dragon deity of Kifune,

18:03.716 --> 18:06.276
rain has fallen once again.

18:06.652 --> 18:11.457
The golden brace will be used
to seal your powers soon.

18:11.457 --> 18:14.449
Masahiro will be drenched.
Let's go.

18:22.668 --> 18:26.439
Gaku and Shun perished
in the battle.

18:26.439 --> 18:30.068
Well, it's all right. Other
options are available.

18:37.116 --> 18:40.779
These minions barely
fill my stomach!

18:45.158 --> 18:47.460
I'm very sorry, Masahiro.

18:47.460 --> 18:51.798
I'm all right.
It was nothing, really.

18:51.798 --> 18:54.300
But I do remember...

18:54.300 --> 18:56.962
Those were my hands...

18:59.972 --> 19:03.709
It was the foreign demons' fault.

19:03.709 --> 19:06.779
I know it was against
your will.

19:06.779 --> 19:08.748
I'm sorry...

19:08.748 --> 19:10.616
Stop crying. It's really fine.

19:10.616 --> 19:13.386
I don't like to see you cry.

19:13.386 --> 19:14.921
Don't fret.

19:14.921 --> 19:18.491
The unskilled, irresponsible,
half-baked onmyouji...

19:18.491 --> 19:22.595
who didn't realize the demons'
plan should be blamed instead.

19:22.595 --> 19:25.198
That's really harsh,
don't you think?

19:25.198 --> 19:27.100
And not only that,

19:27.100 --> 19:30.269
now you owe to the
dragon deity of Kifune.

19:30.269 --> 19:32.672
You could be punished,

19:32.672 --> 19:35.004
if you don't take
your training seriously now.

19:35.508 --> 19:38.500
Mr. Mononoke,
what do you mean?

19:38.578 --> 19:42.639
Well, deities will harass you
if you don't worship them.

19:43.082 --> 19:46.018
One of the most respected
deities in the country,

19:46.018 --> 19:48.654
the deity of Kifune,
was called upon by you.

19:48.654 --> 19:51.023
If you still become
a lousy onmyouji...

19:51.023 --> 19:54.093
after receiving their
blessings, they'll say...

19:54.093 --> 19:58.231
"You idiot!"
And you'll be punished.

19:58.231 --> 20:00.566
That's not fair!

20:00.566 --> 20:00.633
That is!

20:00.633 --> 20:02.535
That is!
Do your best then,
Seimei's grandson.

20:02.535 --> 20:03.002
Do your best then,
Seimei's grandson.

20:03.002 --> 20:04.936
Don't call me grandson!

20:08.274 --> 20:12.040
T-That's how things are, so
don't be too bothered about it.

20:12.778 --> 20:16.145
Oh, Masahiro, here.
Take this.

20:18.718 --> 20:21.821
Master Seimei said that
an awful disaster was averted...

20:21.821 --> 20:24.423
because of the scent's power.

20:24.423 --> 20:27.551
So I was thinking that
it may be useful again.

20:29.061 --> 20:32.588
It really was a great help!
Thank you!

20:33.332 --> 20:37.200
Mokkun, you ought to show your
appreciation. It helped you too.

20:38.004 --> 20:40.907
So, the scent really works?

20:40.907 --> 20:43.205
I'm glad it was
of help to you.

20:47.146 --> 20:48.381
What is it?!

20:48.381 --> 20:51.817
Why are you in a daze? Overwhelmed
by the princess's smile?

20:51.817 --> 20:53.986
That's not true!

20:53.986 --> 20:57.957
N-No... I didn't mean that your
smile wasn't great or anything...

20:57.957 --> 21:00.660
- Wow, you're trying your best.
- Shut up!

21:00.660 --> 21:03.329
Mokkun! Get lost!

21:03.329 --> 21:06.526
But you and Akiko
will be alone then.

21:11.337 --> 21:14.106
Well, it's perfectly
all right with me.

21:14.106 --> 21:16.973
Both of you have fun!

21:17.610 --> 21:21.514
Wait, Mokkun! Don't go,
Mr. Mononoke!

21:21.514 --> 21:24.383
- Don't call me a mononoke!
- Please stay!

21:24.383 --> 21:27.220
- No!
- What?! Don't do this!

21:27.220 --> 21:29.620
- No!
- Hey, wait, Mokkun!

21:42.802 --> 21:54.080
I heard your voice inside
the deep darkness

21:54.080 --> 22:05.625
Just your phrase "I believe"
echoed in my heart

22:05.625 --> 22:11.364
You always stayed by my side

22:11.364 --> 22:17.234
You always gave me courage

22:19.272 --> 22:29.582
In order to continue
protecting our future

22:29.582 --> 22:36.322
I promise you, my beloved

22:36.322 --> 22:41.594
I won't give up

22:41.594 --> 22:47.300
I will keep overcoming my limits

22:47.300 --> 22:54.035
Surely surely surely

22:59.912 --> 23:02.745
Next Episode

23:23.803 --> 23:25.171
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.171 --> 23:26.405
Episode 10.

23:26.405 --> 23:26.939
A Voice in Response
to a Faint Wish.

23:26.939 --> 23:28.774
Episode 10
A Voice in Response
to a Faint Wish
A Voice in Response
to a Faint Wish.

23:28.774 --> 23:29.172
Episode 10
A Voice in Response
to a Faint Wish
